WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Resumes. Start with the resume you already have.

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Resumes. Review the fields and refine your experience.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Resumes. Preview the document before exporting a PDF.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Applications. Bring the role and your original resume together.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Applications. Read suggestions before approving or rejecting them.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Applications. Keep your original and prepare a separate version.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Work. Bring your work into one place.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Work. Describe your contribution and add supporting links.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Work. Choose the work that fits an application.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Cover letters. Start with your experience and the target role.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Cover letters. Review a draft in your own words.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Cover letters. Check the letter before exporting a PDF.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Portfolio. Choose work to include in your portfolio.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Portfolio. Review the content and public visibility.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Portfolio. Publish only when you are ready.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.000
LinkedIn. Bring profile text and choose a target role.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.000
LinkedIn. Compare a suggested draft with its source evidence.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.000
LinkedIn. Review and copy the wording yourself.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Analytics. See the documents and applications you have saved.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Analytics. Review your recent activity.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Analytics. Use the overview to decide what to work on next.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Settings. Find your workspace preferences.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Settings. Choose how you want documents to look.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Settings. Keep editor and preview options within reach.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Zebu. Ask a question about your workspace.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Zebu. See a suggested destination or saved item.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Zebu. Open the relevant page and stay in control.
